      "id": "ent-x-connection-close",
      "name": "WordPress: no keep-alive (new connection per request)",
      "notes": "Sends Connection: close, so every request pays for a new TCP and TLS handshake: the cost for clients that do not reuse connections (scripts, some mobile SDKs, health checkers). Shows load balancer and TLS termination limits. Reference request: wordpress single post (uncached).",
